id: SCA-031
title: CMake execute_process with network command
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: CMakeLists.txt
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: execute_process\s*\(.*COMMAND.*(curl|wget|python|bash|sh\s)
    message: execute_process runs commands during CMake configure step with developer full privileges. Network calls here are a supply chain risk.
fix: Avoid network calls in CMake configure step. Use FetchContent or ExternalProject with hash verification instead.
